      "message": "Name bike-shedding:\n\nWhat\u0027s vms ?\nIdeally this name would relate to connectToVsockServer over in the host.\nstart_vsock_service ?\n\nDoes this method return? If not (if it blocks the thread waiting for connections) we should document that, and probably call it run_vsock_service or something similar.\n\nHow do we signal failure?",
