      "writtenOn": "2022-10-03T15:23:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I adjusted the naming.\n\n\u003e How do we signal failure?\n\nI have checked a couple of usages of rust_ffi in the code base[1]. I don\u0027t see a good way to signal failure like passing Result or using error status code. I think we can return a boolean for void functions or check whether the returned pointer is null to signal failure.\n\nOtherwise if the native library is written in rust, users could get more information from this API.\n\n[1] https://cs.android.com/search?q\u003drust_ffi%20f:bp",
